    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet hn-vs-548098d5ace2</b></p><a name=\"hn-vs-548098d5ace2\"> </a><a name=\"hchn-vs-548098d5ace2\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html\"><code>http://ltc-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/hn-answer</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version &#x1F4E6;1.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c76c4aa75dddb\">c76c4aa75dddb</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">總是潮溼：皮膚總是被汗水、大小便等浸潤；每兩小時予病人翻身時，都會發現皮膚是潮溼的</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c8d37e00811db\">c8d37e00811db</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">經常潮溼：皮膚經常是浸潤的；衣褲/尿布/看護墊等至少每8小時需更換≧2次</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c80c1c9b3a245\">c80c1c9b3a245</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">偶爾潮溼：皮膚偶爾是浸潤的；衣褲/尿布/看護墊等至少每8小時需更換1次</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-cc20b48ecd52d\">cc20b48ecd52d</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">很少潮溼：皮膚通常保持乾燥；衣褲/尿布/看護墊等只需要依常規的時間，每天更換一次</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
